  "_readme": [
    "This file lists every supplier the scraper pulls from. To add a new supplier",
    "YOURSELF (no coding needed), copy one of the objects in \"suppliers\" below,",
    "edit name/website/categories, and set \"handler\" to one of the values listed",
    "in _available_handlers - but ONLY if you already confirmed that handler works",
    "for this site using the workflow test_url input (Actions tab -> Run workflow).",
    "If none of the existing handlers match (test mode says so), this file alone",
    "is not enough - a new handler needs to be written in scripts/update_catalog.py,",
    "which needs someone who can code (ask Claude, or write it yourself).",
    "Edit this file directly on GitHub: click it, click the pencil/edit icon,",
    "make your change, commit. No local tools needed."
  ],
